{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 32, :comments ["<b>From the children of Heth.</b> Even though he already said 'from Ephron the Hittite,' he went back and said 'from the children of Heth,' because Ephron was no longer alive at that time. And since Joseph had not been present at the time of the purchase, he explained the entire matter to him — what he should say to the heirs if they refuse."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 49, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:09:20.790428393Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}